        {
            "id": "bacbc311-e9f8-4303-91c4-9f7d00d34915",
            "build_id": "d4769eb7-c417-4fc5-b01e-abc89c051e2c",
            "round_number": 2,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-13T12:37:07.644345+00:00",
            "notes": "POWER = [Cosmic Coolant](item_5584169d-94af-4efa-955c-263353a75553) *OR* [Medicinal Missiles](item_30eeab6c-4a1e-4a16-b9dd-e83d633caa40)\n\nPick the power based on how fights are going, if your team is dying faster than both supports can heal choose [Medicinal Missiles](item_30eeab6c-4a1e-4a16-b9dd-e83d633caa40)!\n\nI find I use [Medicinal Missiles](item_30eeab6c-4a1e-4a16-b9dd-e83d633caa40) more than [Cosmic Coolant](item_5584169d-94af-4efa-955c-263353a75553) out of safety, especially paired with [Multi-tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) for increased cooldown%\n\nITEMS = \n\nI *always* chose [Lock-On Shield](item_220287f8-1dc5-4a6c-9e86-c14cf970b689) first, then buy what I can afford. Typically I can get 4 blues and 2 greens.\n\nBLUES =\n\n[Lock-On Shield](item_220287f8-1dc5-4a6c-9e86-c14cf970b689)\n\n[Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2)\n\n[Multi-tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56)\n\n[Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e)\n\nIn that order! I prefer [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) to [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) because of the [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power), followed by [Multi-tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) for the [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction). [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) helps me stay alive through fights\n\nGREENS =\n\n[First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da)\nIdeal when paired with [Lock-On Shield](item_220287f8-1dc5-4a6c-9e86-c14cf970b689), adds to your overhealth gained!\n\n[Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) for more AP\n\n\n>TOTAL HP = 332\n>\n>SHIELD = 175\n>\n>WEAPON = 5%\n>\n>ABILITY = 40% (+30)\n>\n>COOLDOWN = 5%\n>\n>LIFESTEAL = 10%",
